ROUTE D.outR TO A.inR
ROUTE D.outN TO A.inN
ROUTE D.outMN TO A.inMN
ROUTE STEP.cycleTime TO A.tick
ROUTE STEP.cycleTime TO D.tick
ROUTE STEP.cycleTime TO R.tick

